+    /// A real GAF row never spans its path end to end: the first and last unitig carry graph
+    /// context outside the gene (`align.rs` REAL: path_len 1288, path_start 7, path_end 1281).
+    /// The swap has to work on that shape. It used to be discarded, because the post-stitch
